      },
      "message": "test(sinker): write the rough/finish pair as two CL goldens, one stream each\n\nsinker_undersize wrote the rough and finish CL texts concatenated into one\ngolden, so the file held two ; HSMW-CL headers. The CL reader merges them\ninto one path, so camcraft-cl's cl_text_round_trips_every_golden failed on\nmain. Each pass is now its own golden; the bytes are the same two streams.\n\nFixes #1374\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
